# Exclude everything we don't need in the build context. The Dockerfile
# COPYs go.mod/go.sum and the three source trees (api/, cmd/, internal/)
# explicitly, so anything not under those is safe to skip — and skipping
# it speeds up the build context tar significantly.
#
# We use an exclusion-by-name approach (rather than the kubebuilder-default
# "** + selective re-include" pattern) because podman/buildah resolve the
# directory glob `api/` against the result of the dockerignore filter, and
# the re-include pattern `!**/*.go` doesn't preserve the enclosing
# directories for them.

.git
.github
bin
charts
config
docs
dist
release
hack
test
testdata

# Editor / OS noise
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store

# Test files are not needed for image builds.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
